        "it": "Sì, i clienti confermano visite specialistiche e interventi d'urgenza per conigli nani, tartarughe e piccoli roditori.",
        "en": "Yes, clients confirm specialized appointments and emergency treatments for dwarf rabbits, turtles, and small rodents."
